<title>UK: First oil well to be drilled off Dublin Bay - agency.</title>
<headline>First oil well to be drilled off Dublin Bay - agency.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>An oil exploration well will be drilled off Dublin Bay for the first time in more than a decade with Enterprise Oil planning to begin exploration in the area later this year, the Press Association news agency reported.</p>
<p>It quoted junior Irish Energy Minister Emmet Staff as saying the discovery of gas and oil in similar geological conditions in Liverpool Bay had made it important to carry out exploration off Dublin.</p>
<p>It will be the first well to operate in the area since 1986.</p>
<p>((-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7630))</p>
